178284,-0.02726002410054207,0.08220828324556351,0.040025241672992706,0.022759435698390007,0.014810250140726566],"metadata":{"id":"365edca9-5ca3-47e9-95dd-808cc81dbd4c","url":"file:///app/collector/hotdir/task_adherence_procedures.md","title":"task_adherence_procedures.md","docAuthor":"Unknown","description":"Unknown","docSource":"a text file uploaded by the user.","chunkSource":"","published":"7/4/2025, 6:37:21 AM","wordCount":82,"token_count_estimate":138,"text":"<document_metadata>\nsourceDocument: task_adherence_procedures.md\npublished: 7/4/2025, 6:37:21 AM\n</document_metadata>\n\n# Task Adherence and Validation Procedures\n\n1. **Pre-Task Checks**\n- Verify current context is relevant\n- Confirm all necessary tools are available\n- Review relevant existing memories before starting\n\n2. **During-Task Validation**\n- Call think_about_task_adherence before any code changes\n- Use think_about_collected_information after research steps\n- Maintain focus on current user request without diverging\n\n3. **Progress Tracking**\n- Document key decision points\n- Track completion of sub-tasks\n- Validate results before moving to next steps\n\n4. **Context Preservation**\n- Save important context changes during task execution\n- Track user preferences and decisions\n- Maintain awareness of task dependencies"}}]]